r','Please tell us about any allergy before ordering. We handle multiple allergens in our kitchen, so cross-contact may occur. Our team can provide the current allergen information and help you make an informed choice.'),(181,4,'_faq_2_answer','field_faq_2_answer'),(182,4,'faq_3_question','Do you offer takeaway and delivery?'),(183,4,'_faq_3_question','field_faq_3_question'),(184,4,'faq_3_answer','Yes. You can order online for collection or local delivery. Availability, delivery areas and estimated times are shown during checkout.'),(185,4,'_faq_3_answer','field_faq_3_answer'),(186,4,'faq_4_question','Do I need to book banquet meals in advance?'),(187,4,'_faq_4_question','field_faq_4_question'),(188,4,'faq_4_answer','Advance booking is recommended for banquet meals, especially during peak dining times and weekends.'),(189,4,'_faq_4_answer','field_faq_4_answer'),(190,4,'faq_5_question','Can you cater for groups or private events?'),(191,4,'_faq_5_question','field_faq_5_question'),(192,4,'faq_5_answer','Yes, subject to availability. Contact us with the date, guest numbers and requirements, and our team will discuss the options with you.'),(193,4,'_faq_5_answer','field_faq_5_answer'),(194,4,'faq_6_question','Is parking available?'),(195,4,'_faq_6_question','field_faq_6_question'),(196,4,'faq_6_answer','Street and public car parking options are available in Hemel Hempstead Old Town within short walking distance.'),(197,4,'_faq_6_answer','field_faq_6_answer'),(201,31,'_wp_attached_file','2026/09/about.jpg'),(202,31,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1096;s:6:\"height\";i:745;s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"2026/09/about.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:207368;s:5:\"sizes\";a:7:{s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"about-300x204.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:204;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:18636;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:18:\"about-1024x696.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1024;s:6:\"height\";i:696;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";