quirements, and our team will discuss the options with you.'),(3626,182,'_faq_5_answer','field_faq_5_answer'),(3627,182,'faq_6_question','Is parking available?'),(3628,182,'_faq_6_question','field_faq_6_question'),(3629,182,'faq_6_answer','Street and public car parking options are available in Hemel Hempstead Old Town within short walking distance.'),(3630,182,'_faq_6_answer','field_faq_6_answer'),(3631,182,'hero_bg_image','34'),(3632,182,'_hero_bg_image','field_hero_bg_image'),(3633,182,'about_image','31'),(3634,182,'_about_image','field_about_image'),(3635,182,'banquet_dish_image',''),(3636,182,'_banquet_dish_image','field_banquet_dish_image'),(3637,182,'banquet_bg_image',''),(3638,182,'_banquet_bg_image','field_banquet_bg_image'),(3639,182,'delivery_image',''),(3640,182,'_delivery_image','field_delivery_image'),(3641,182,'dietary_bg_image',''),(3642,182,'_dietary_bg_image','field_dietary_bg_image'),(3643,182,'faq_bottom_art',''),(3644,182,'_faq_bottom_art','field_faq_bottom_art'),(3645,182,'faq_7_question',''),(3646,182,'_faq_7_question','field_faq_7_question'),(3647,182,'faq_7_answer',''),(3648,182,'_faq_7_answer','field_faq_7_answer'),(3649,182,'faq_8_question',''),(3650,182,'_faq_8_question','field_faq_8_question'),(3651,182,'faq_8_answer',''),(3652,182,'_faq_8_answer','field_faq_8_answer'),(3659,183,'footnotes',''),(3661,183,'hero_title','Authentic Kerala Cuisine in Hemel Hempstead\'s Old Town'),(3662,183,'_hero_title','field_hero_title'),(3663,183,'hero_desc','Proudly serving the local community since 2003. Discover the distinctive flavours of Kerala, freshly prepared and served with the warmth of traditional South Indian hospitality.'),(3664,183,'_hero_desc','field_hero_desc'),(3665,183,'hero_btn1_text','BOOK A TABLE'),(3666,183,'_hero_btn1_text','field_hero_btn1_text'),(3667,183,'hero_btn1_url','/book-a-table/'),(3668,183,'_hero_btn1_url','field_hero_btn1_url'),(3669,183,'hero_btn2_text','ORDER ONLINE'),(3670,183,'_hero_btn2_text','field_hero_btn2_text'),(